# =============================================================================
# Amiterra Tuning Pipeline — Platform Prep Profile
# =============================================================================
# WARNING: This file is part of the Amiterra tuning pipeline.
# Public documentation and audits MUST reference these exact sources.
# Do not edit values without updating docs and running the tune test suite.
#
# Layer:      Platform Prep (applied by `ami init` / `ami tune platform`)
# Scope:      Minimal host sysctls required for Kubernetes pod networking
# Reversible: yes (`ami tune rollback`, `ami uninstall`)
# Embedded:   compiled into the ami binary via include_str! (build-time)
# Source:     tuning/platform.sysctl
# Docs:       https://github.com/amiterra/amiterra-cli/tree/main/tuning
# =============================================================================
#
# Format: native sysctl drop-in (`key = value`). Comments start with `#`.
# This exact text is written to /etc/sysctl.d/98-amiterra-platform.conf.

# --- OS subsystem: kernel networking (IPv4/IPv6 forwarding) ----------------
# Required for pod → pod and pod → external routing on the host.
net.ipv4.ip_forward = 1
net.ipv6.conf.all.forwarding = 1
